# When Angels Fall (battlefield.when_angels_fall, The Garden of Ru'Hmet): the registrant's requirements (8-3 current,
# Mission[6][828]Status 4). Each gets a lone release (no menu): main (8-3 at Status 6), bob (Dawn current with Status
# 4) and cat (A Fate Decided current with Status 4).
lists TheGardenOfRuhmet/_0z0/onTrigger
char zone=TheGardenOfRuhmet pos=420,-2,404 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
char bob zone=TheGardenOfRuhmet pos=420,-2,404 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
char cat zone=TheGardenOfRuhmet pos=420,-2,404 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Cop WhenAngelsFall current
charvar Mission[6][828]Status 6
bob: mission Cop Dawn current
bob: charvar Mission[6][828]Status 4
cat: mission Cop AFateDecided current
cat: charvar Mission[6][828]Status 4
login
trigger _0z0
finish-if-event
bob: login
bob: trigger _0z0
bob: finish-if-event
cat: login
cat: trigger _0z0
cat: finish-if-event
